  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEsvPsnqJpz\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\">⚠️ 需要 Epicfight 最新版本</p>\n<p><strong>EpicFight : 踢擊技能</strong> 是從 Annoying Villagers 1.4 模組分離出來的模組。它新增了一項被動技能，允許你透過新的鍵位設定進行踢擊並造成耐力傷害；此外，當你格擋破裂或陷入眩暈狀態時，可以再次按下踢擊鍵來脫困。</p>\n<p>內附設定檔，可讓你調整踢擊造成的耐力傷害數值。</p>\n<p>耐力傷害機制僅對玩家與 Combat Evolution 模組的生物生效。</p>",
